      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p068-c5",
      "start": 873,
      "end": 888,
      "groups": [
        "p068-textual-coordination-7fa10c3f98"
      ],
      "sourceText": "مَالٍ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p068-u0010",
      "text": "فرزندان فراوان است.",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(1) > span:nth-of-type(2)",
      "textHash": "dd883ae218fa72211545e00b10dc68ea021624beea298aaea7fc8259196eba50",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-200 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dashed ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 14,
      "blockIndex": 5,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p068-c5",
      "start": 894,
      "end": 914,
      "groups": [
        "p068-textual-coordination-7fa10c3f98"
      ],
      "sourceText": "بَنِينَ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p068-u0011",
      "text": "خوردند که صبحگاهان حتماً میوه های باغ را بچینند،",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(2) > p:nth-of-type(1) > span:nth-of-type(1)",
      "textHash": "152a49fce8757ba865d1703858587e503536666d353e8a609a4ec1131e3a0ee7",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-100 ul-pad-x-0mm ul-pad-y-1px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0mm ul-pad-y-1px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 17,
      "blockIndex": 6,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": "p068-s0001",
      "contextId": "p068-c6",
      "start": 1264,
      "end": 1312,
      "groups": [
        "p068-textual-coordination-f2cfd0455d"
      ],
      "sourceText": "لَيَصْرِمُنَّهَا مُصْبِحِينَ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p068-u0012",
      "text": "از آن را [برای تهیدستان و نیازمندان] استثنا نکردند.",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(2) > p:nth-of-type(1) > span:nth-of-type(2)",
      "textHash": "42d837cceee09edb33515cb6805816c121122cf52964f828490b2ca803429904",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-100 ul-pad-x-0mm ul-pad-y-1px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0mm ul-pad-y-1px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 18,
      "blockIndex": 6,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": "p068-s0001",
      "contextId": "p068-c6",
      "start": 1320,
      "end": 1372,
      "groups": [
        "p068-textual-coordination-f2cfd0455d"
      ],
      "sourceText": "لَا يَسْتَثْنُونَ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p068-u0013",
      "text": "کسانی",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(3) > div:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(6) > span:nth-of-type(1)",
      "textHash": "2bcb3b407fada85c78338a6ec4ce77f2a9f98c976e3aac8731f0e28c07246b1d",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-220 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 44,
      "blockIndex": 7,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p068-c7",
      "start": 4113,
      "end": 4118,
      "groups": [
        "p068-textual-coordination-af67a8ae7b"
      ],
      "sourceText": "ي"
    },
    {
      "id": "p068-u0014",
      "text": "که این قرآن را انکار می کنند واگذار، به زودی ما",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(3) > div:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(6) > span:nth-of-type(2)",
      "textHash": "c8a43cb703248284279914ec3b8b089f09a718958db6dc1159c5ed7ae4e23c06",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-220 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 44,
      "blockIndex": 7,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p068-c7",
      "start": 4119,
      "end": 4167,
      "groups": [
        "p068-textual-coordination-af67a8ae7b"
      ],
      "sourceText": "مَن يُكَذِّبُ بِهَـٰذَا الْحَدِيثِ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p068-u0015",
      "text": "آنان را به تدریج از آن جا که نمی دانند [به سوی عذاب] می کشانیم؛",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(3) > div:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(6) > span:nth-of-type(3)",
      "textHash": "5dd2805eb7ab3f7f4ecb536ecb712b97daf3935aa6029d0e202f76506d66f200",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-100 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-2px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-2px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 44,
      "blockIndex": 7,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p068-c7",
      "start": 4168,
      "end": 4233,
      "groups": [
        "p068-textual-coordination-e70cdced63"
      ],
      "sourceText": "سَنَسْتَدْرِجُهُم مِّنْ حَيْثُ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p068-u0016",
      "text": "آنان را مهلت می دهیم [تا گناهشان را در",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(3) > div:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(6) > span:nth-of-type(4)",
      "textHash": "766046562d58c5693afddbcb90eb509b584c3c74d970cab22a475856804c1f87",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-100 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-2px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-dotted ul-sides-open ul-thickness-2px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 45,
      "blockIndex": 7,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p068-c7",
      "start": 4244,
      "end": 4285,
      "groups": [
        "p068-textual-coordination-e70cdced63"
      ],
      "sourceText": "أُمْلِي لَهُمْ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p068-u0017",
      "text": "برابر حکم و قضای پروردگارت [که هلاک کردن تدریجی این طاغیان است] شکیبا",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(9) > span:nth-of-type(1)",
      "textHash": "54a71c9b22a59e761381b1a2288306013b3798f4fd9366d628ec02190c2bed55",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-220 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 48,
      "blockIndex": 8,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p068-c8",
      "start": 4717,
      "end": 4786,
      "groups": [
        "p068-textual-coordination-e35fe5deb8"
      ],
      "sourceText": "اصْبِرْ لِحُكْمِ رَبِّكَ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p068-u0018",
      "text": "و مانند صاحب ماهی [یونس] مباش [که شتاب در آمدن عذاب را برای قومش خواست و به این علت در شکم ماهی محبوس شد] و در آن حال با دلی مالامال از اندوه، خدا را ندا داد.",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > p:nth-of-type(9) > span:nth-of-type(2)",
      "textHash": "510524fe787ade9b9c0c970ebb0928aad8e278dea8c5ac5a576df1862fbe00ee",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-220 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 48,
      "blockIndex": 8,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": null,
      "contextId": "p068-c8",
      "start": 4791,
      "end": 4949,
      "groups": [
        "p068-textual-coordination-e35fe5deb8"
      ],
      "sourceText": "لَا تَكُن كَصَاحِبِ الْحُوتِ إِذْ نَادَىٰ وَهُوَ مَكْظُومٌ"
    }
  ],
